paparazzi/models/get_first_order_low_pass/rocq/functional/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith Lia.
From compcert Require Import Coqlib Integers Floats AST Values Memory Memdata Csem Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassGet Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveLowpassGetCase Require Import Contract GetCall.
From FiveGuidanceAllOrder Require Import PureSyntax CallfreeExecution.
From FiveLowpassSupport Require Import LowpassMemory Straightline.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Definition NormalCompletion:Prop:=forall m b p value,ReadableOut m b p value->exists t mf,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args b p)m)t(Returnstate(Vsingle value)Kstop mf) /\Post m mf b p value.
Definition AllReturns:Prop:=forall m b p value,ReadableOut m b p value->forall t result mf,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args b p)m)t(Returnstate result Kstop mf)->result=Vsingle value /\Post m mf b p value.

paparazzi/models/get_first_order_low_pass/rocq/execution_correspondence/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith.
From compcert Require Import AST Values Memory Events Ctypes Csyntax Csem Cexec Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassGet Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveGuidanceSemantics Require Import SourceClosure.
From FiveLowpassGetExecutionCorrespondence Require Import Closure.
Import ListNotations.
Definition source_state := Closure.SS.
Definition closed_step := Closure.closed_step.
Definition domain_preservation_goal:Prop := forall args m,
 Execution.entry args m=Callstate(Internal Source.f_get_first_order_low_pass)args Kstop m /\ source_state(Execution.entry args m).
Definition reachable_step_goal:Prop := forall args m t reached tr next,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t reached ->
 (closed_step tt reached tr next <-> Csem.step Execution.ge reached tr next).
Definition floating_point_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition machine_integer_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition memory_access_correspondence_goal := reachable_step_goal.
Definition control_and_exhaustion_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t final,
 star closed_step tt(Execution.entry args m)t final <->
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t final.
Definition normal_result_and_memory_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t v mf b ofs n,
 (star closed_step tt(Execution.entry args m)t(Returnstate v Kstop mf) <->
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t(Returnstate v Kstop mf)) /\
 Execution.observe_bytes mf b ofs n=Mem.loadbytes mf b ofs n.
Definition invalid_operation_correspondence_goal:Prop := forall args m t reached,
 star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m)t reached ->
 (Execution.source_error reached <-> ~Execution.normal_return reached /\ nostep closed_step tt reached).
Definition whole_execution_correspondence_goal := control_and_exhaustion_correspondence_goal.

paparazzi/models/get_first_order_low_pass/rocq/no_error/problem/Spec.v
From Stdlib Require Import List ZArith Lia.
From compcert Require Import Coqlib Integers Floats AST Values Memory Memdata Csem Smallstep.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassGet Require Import Source Execution.
From FiveLowpassGetCase Require Import Contract GetCall.
From FiveGuidanceAllOrder Require Import PureSyntax CallfreeExecution.
From FiveLowpassSupport Require Import LowpassMemory Straightline.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Definition NoError:Prop:=forall args m,Precondition args m->no_error Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m).

paparazzi/models/get_first_order_low_pass/rocq/termination/problem/Spec.v
From compcert Require Import Values Memory.
From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
From FiveLowpassGet Require Import Execution.
Definition AllSuccessorsTerminate : Prop := forall args m,Acc(successor Execution.ge)(Execution.entry args m).

